So, this is what I end up doing...which, in retrospect, was not the most
efficient way, but tought me how to do it next time this problem arise.

One of the biggest problem here was the lack of water (holy).  There were at
least 3 things that wanted to be blessed (lamp, ?of remove curse, and a
magic marker, not to mention some of the weapons eventually wanna be
blessed) and needed to have some 'unimportant' potions figured out so they
could be diluted.  I went ahead and decided to dilute the potions of
sickness.  However, there were 2 uncursed potions and 1 cursed potions.  I
didn't want to dip'em separately, so I used the unicorn horn to make all of
them into uncursed fruit juice so I could dip'em all together.

The cursed potion of sickness turned into an uncursed red-purple
potion...which I had 2 more of!  So, now I've got 5 potions I can dilute.
This increased my holy water count up to 6, and from there, the stack of 3
scrolls of ID was blessed.  I then IDed a stack of 3 scrolls @ $80 along
with uncursed rings.  This turned out to be remove curse scrolls.  I blessed
them and read one of them to get rid of massive number of cursed items.  I
also IDed another stack of 6 cyan potions.  This turned out to be object
detection potion.  More potions I can dilute for later use.

Interesting thing about the potion of object detection was that I kept
getting them from the nymphs.  I suspect nymphs have a high drop rate of the
said potion, along with the mirrors.  So, next time, I could just keep my
eyes on the potions nymphs drop, and figure out which potion is potion of
object detection...

Also, I later had an idea to dip my violet gems into potions to see if I can
find some booze.  None was found, but this should have been done also.

So, the final answer to my question was:
Dip the unicorn horn into 1 potion of sickness, to figure out which potions
are fruit juices
Remember which potions were dropped by nymphs repeatedly
Dip violet gems into potions to figure out which potions are booze
Get good number of holy water from the potion of sickness, fruit juice,
booze, and potion of object detection.
Bless the stack of 3 scrolls of $80.  They must be either enchant armor or
remove curse.  Pick up all the cursed items, remove all the armors except
one you want to bless, read the scroll.  If this is remove curse, everything
in the inventry is uncursed.  If this is enchant armor, the single armor
worn is enchanted, and the stack of scrolls are auto-IDed, and we'll know
what the other $80 scroll was also.
Finally, bless the scrolls of ID, and read'em.

You can leave the magic markers alone if you wish to wait for later.

